  invariant only a server-configured loopback endpoint can execute; browser-selected destinations cannot expand it and redirects are refused
  invariant request data contains one exercise prescription and optionally that exercise from one explicitly selected completed session; member identity, weigh-ins and unrelated history are excluded
  invariant model output is a closed validated proposal; a separate expected-revision write applies it and refuses a changed routine
  forbidden_inference a valid proposal or successful HTTP response -> correct exercise advice, satisfied equipment constraints, authorized application or hosted-provider integration
  known_gap live proposal quality and complete browser application remain unverified; model execution is disconnected after a resource incident, and no additional local models should be started on this machine
  known_gap hosted credentials, provider routing and native decision/admission integration remain unconnected

interaction member-training-requests-model-proposal
  source member-training
  destination training-model-proposal
  via components/BonfyreServiceSite/training-workspace.mjs /api/training/propose
  preserves the reviewed exercise request, explicit selected-session scope and hashes of the actual model request and response
  drops unrelated history, body-weight records, member identity and authority to mutate training
  forbids saved model preferences or a received proposal automatically sending additional records or changing a routine

architecture training-creator-request
  experience_chain learning
  experience_chain service-case
  experience_chain project
  canonical_name TrainingCreatorRequest
  family apps
  domain Creator operations / Program delivery
  layer integration
  semantic_question How can a member request a creator program change, track native work, and explicitly adopt its delivered routine?
  purpose A local bridge from a reviewed member brief into native WorkGraph, with private receipt reads and immutable delivered-program artifacts.
  maturity implemented
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/training-requests.mjs
