interaction training-request-uses-native-workgraph
  source training-creator-request
  destination work-graph
  via cmd/BonfyreQueue/bonfyre-queue enqueue, claim, renew, ack and mission
  preserves native lifecycle, claim ownership, lease expiry, creator routing family and completion receipt
  drops a separate application-owned work status database
  forbids writing delivered program state before native completion or treating a claim as a paid coaching agreement

