  witness packs/no-simulation/fitness-studio-20261011/creator-browser-verification.json records member submission, native creator sign-in, assignment, routine editing, review, delivery, member adoption, revocation and logout through the browser
  witness packs/no-simulation/fitness-studio-20261011/draft-browser-verification.json records requested-program reuse, unfinished draft reload, full browser restart, two-tab save conflicts, stale review refusal and delivery of the latest reviewed draft
