  witness packs/no-simulation/fitness-studio-20261011/plan-browser-verification.json records three-week authoring, recovery weeks, conflicting tabs, reviewed publication, member date choice, offline workout completion, version preservation and withdrawal
  invariant a studio plan resolves routine versions from its own library or already saved snapshots; client-supplied routine bodies cannot change its targets
  invariant plan drafts and releases use native CMS identity and revision admission under the studio's current program grant
  invariant an adopted plan contains its selected routine snapshots and a member-chosen calendar start date; catalogue changes cannot rewrite either
  invariant plan completion derives from a finished workout's enrollment and slot coordinates; skip and restore never manufacture workouts
  invariant a planned session honors its prescribed load instead of generic last-workout prefilling; explicitly configured progression rules remain applicable
  invariant date offsets count calendar days across month, leap-year and daylight-saving boundaries; one slot cannot own two workouts
  invariant planned sessions, skips and workout coordinates survive the member's existing training export and offline store
  forbidden_inference published schedule or completed session count -> paid entitlement, coach consent, full target adherence or improved health
  known_gap plans support up to 52 weeks, 14 sessions per week and 50 distinct routine snapshots within a 64 KB release; the local store holds 100 drafts and 100 releases per studio
  known_gap individual date moves, calendar reminders, pause/rebase scheduling, archived-plan browsing and per-slot overrides remain open; variant targets use separately saved routine versions

interaction creator-plans-use-native-cms
  source training-weekly-plans
  destination cmd-c-m-s
  via training-plan-store.mjs guarded draft updates and unique versioned release entries
  preserves studio scope, source snapshots, revision checks, actor attribution, publication retry identity and withdrawal state
  drops client authority to supply private routine data or overwrite an admitted version
  forbids saving or reviewing a plan being read as publication

interaction weekly-plans-reference-program-versions
  source training-weekly-plans
  destination training-program-publication
  via studio routine choices and saved plan snapshots
  preserves routine identity, version, exercise identity and prescribed targets
  drops automatic replacement by a newer routine version
  forbids withdrawing or editing a source routine from changing an already saved or adopted plan

interaction member-training-follows-weekly-plan
  source member-training
  destination training-weekly-plans
  via plan adoption and start commands in the existing training state
  preserves one member-owned workout history, explicit start date, skipped sessions and exact adopted plan version
  drops a creator-owned progress ledger or completion flags disconnected from workout evidence
  forbids plan progress, publication or withdrawal from granting the creator access to personal training

architecture training-device-connections
  canonical_name TrainingDeviceConnections
  family apps
  domain Personal applications / Fitness devices
  layer integration
  semantic_question How do sensor readings, recorded watch workouts and phone calendars enter the member experience without becoming invented training completions?
  purpose A device screen for Bluetooth heart-rate pairing, reviewed TCX workout imports and phone calendar handoff
  maturity implemented
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/training-devices.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/training-device-files.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/training-device-view.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/training-client.mjs
  witness components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/training-devices.test.mjs checks Bluetooth flags, contact loss, truncated packets, disconnect races, workout identity, pause refusal, duplicate import and calendar escaping
  witness components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/training-devices-browser.test.mjs exercises offline calendar downloads, successful sharing, cancellation, permission refusal, failed capability probes and direct downloads without changing member records
  witness packs/no-simulation/fitness-studio-20261011/devices-browser-verification.json records reviewed file import, live readings through test notifications, explicit recording, editing preservation, offline recovery and mobile layout
  internal_calculus the Bluetooth collector reads standard service 0x180D and characteristic 0x2A37 after the browser chooser; contact loss and stale readings clear the displayed value
  internal_calculus opted-in recording samples at most once per five seconds into the revision-checked active workout; it never marks a set complete and refuses a paused or different workout
  internal_calculus TCX activity totals become separately identified member records after review; normalized content identity prevents repeated-file duplication without merging them into strength sets
  internal_calculus bounded TCX parsing refuses document types, external entities, malformed dates and invalid totals; GPS positions and free-text device notes are not imported
  internal_calculus upcoming plan dates become RFC 5545 all-day events with stable identities and escaped folded text; the phone share sheet or calendar file carries the handoff
  invariant device readings and imported workouts remain in the existing member-owned store and portable training export
  invariant choosing a studio never changes the sensor or grants that studio access to its readings
  invariant a pairing or import action cannot expose the complete device health store or change a prescribed plan
  invariant unavailable or rejected calendar sharing falls back to a calendar file; user cancellation produces no download, and direct download remains available independently of sharing support
  forbidden_inference browser protocol tests or imported TCX totals -> physical sensor validation, native Apple Health or Health Connect sync, wrist control, medical accuracy or commercial device certification
  known_gap physical sensor pairing, native companion installation, background watch recording, health-store permissions and remote phone synchronization remain unverified
  known_gap calendar handoff is a snapshot; calendar applications control import, duplicate handling and alerts

interaction training-sensor-readings-enter-member-workout
  source training-device-connections
  destination member-training
  via Bluetooth notifications and heart-rate commands in training-model.mjs
  preserves member choice, active workout identity, reading timestamps, sensor name and local revision checks
  drops raw beat intervals, device energy totals, manufacturer secrets and automatic set completion
  forbids a heart-rate reading becoming a completed set or permission to share member data

interaction watch-workout-files-enter-member-history
  source training-device-connections
  destination member-training
  via reviewed bounded TCX activity imports
  preserves source format, activity date, duration, distance, available whole-workout average heart rate and idempotent content identity
  drops GPS tracks, free-text device notes, automatic strength-session matching and creator access
  forbids an imported watch workout advancing a planned strength session

interaction training-plan-opens-phone-calendar
  source training-weekly-plans
  destination training-device-connections
  via upcoming RFC 5545 events and native share-sheet handoff where supported
  preserves planned calendar date, plan label, exercise names, set counts and stable event identity
  drops private history, sensor readings, automatic calendar subscriptions and reminder authority
  forbids downloading or sharing a calendar file establishing remote calendar acceptance

architecture training-native-watch-companions
  canonical_name TrainingNativeWatchCompanions
  family apps
  domain Mobile and wearable applications / Training
  layer architecture
  semantic_question Which native phone and watch capabilities must be connected for equivalent Apple Watch and Wear OS workout control?
  purpose Equal product behavior through platform-owned workout, connectivity and health permission APIs
  maturity declared
  source_path docs/commercial/fitness-creator-studio-20261011.md
  internal_calculus Apple HealthKit workout sessions and mirrored phone sessions; WatchConnectivity for durable plan transfer; Wear OS Health Services ExerciseClient and Data Layer for the Android companion; Health Connect for separately consented phone health records
  invariant each companion owns a human-facing session screen, permission flow, connection status, current exercise, rest clock and acknowledged controls
  invariant retries reuse workout and command identities; timestamps, source device and explicit conflict handling survive disconnection
  forbidden_inference a shared device screen or documented platform contract -> built, signed, installed or hardware-tested native companion apps
  known_gap native targets, platform permission UX, background lifecycle, signed deployment and physical-device acceptance remain to be implemented

interaction native-watch-companions-use-device-boundary
  source training-native-watch-companions
  destination training-device-connections
  via planned native workout and connectivity adapters
  preserves member ownership, explicit sharing scope, workout identity and platform permission decisions
  drops assumption that either watch family exposes a generic browser Bluetooth heart-rate service
  forbids prototype protocol support implying native watch application availability

interaction atlas-workflow-declarations-enter-experience-map
  source atlas-provenance
  destination cmd-experience-map
  via architecture/atlas-index.mjs loadVerifiedAtlas and cmd/BonfyreExperienceMap/tools/atlas_bindings.mjs
  preserves exact workflow IDs, architecture IDs, source paths, interaction references and forbidden inferences; owner_graph retains all exported architectures and interactions for read-only native resolution
  drops inferred inheritance from a schema to its parent command or neighboring files
  forbids candidate workflow association granting execution authority, paid entitlement or evidence of completed work
  invalidates_on changed atlas declaration digest or unavailable declared source
  witness cmd/BonfyreExperienceMap/tests/atlas_bindings.test.mjs

interaction training-team-administers-native-grants
  source training-creator-access
  destination cmd-auth
  via components/BonfyreServiceSite/training-creator.mjs team routes invoke institution-members-stdin and institution-member-set-stdin
  preserves current session and scoped administrator checks, existing account identity, exact institution, native transaction ordering and delegation expiry
  drops arbitrary institution names from browser input, global user enumeration and implicit account creation
  forbids a request administrator granting program access, an expiring administrator creating perpetual grants or direct grant removal implying removal of inherited authority
